    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS take great pleasure in presenting this absolutely fantastic two-bedroom penthouse apartment to the market within the prestigious Fortunes Lawn development, Citywest. The phrase 'location, location, location' immediately springs to mind as this magnificent development is ideally positioned less than five minutes' walk from the Luas and also within a mere stone's throw you will find the Citywest Shopping Centre, choice of bus routes giving easy access to the City Centre and a host of major road networks.\r\n\r\nBright, airy and most spacious internal living accommodation of c. 87 sqm comprises of entrance hallway with storage rooms, modern fully fitted kitchen, large open plan living/dining area, two double bedrooms (one master ensuite) both with built in wardrobes and main family bathroom. A door from the living & bedrooms lead onto private balcony of the lowest maintenance with beautiful views of the Dublin Mountains. It is further benefitted by a highly sought after south facing orientation making it perfect for relaxing on them long sunny summer evenings. \r\n\r\nNo. 75 comes to the market in great condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners with no expense spared when upgrading in recent years, it has been fully renovated from top to bottom with fresh painting throughout. These apartments are exceptionally spacious and offer a lengthy list of striking features such as double-glazed windows, electric heating, ample parking and sunny south facing balcony to name but a few. \r\n\r\nMixed interest is sure to be seen from a wide range of buyers such as first-time buyers looking to get on the property ladder, investors looking to capitalise on the strong rents in the area and people looking to downsize. \r\n\r\nRegister your interest today with Ray Cooke Auctioneers. \r\n\r\nAdditional Features; \r\n- c. 87 sqm \r\n- BER D\r\n- Management fees c. 2,150 per annum \r\n- 2 bed 2 bath \r\n- Top floor apartment \r\n- Penthouse apartment \r\n- Superbly maintained \r\n- Great condition throughout\r\n- Tastefully decorated \r\n- Fully renovated in recent years \r\n- Double glazed windows \r\n- Fully fitted kitchen \r\n- Electric heating\r\n- Entrance hallway \r\n- Ample storage \r\n- Large open plan living/dining area\r\n- Two double bedrooms \r\n- Master ensuite \r\n- Built in wardrobes \r\n- Main family bathroom \r\n- Private balcony \r\n- Sunny south facing balcony \r\n- Stunning views \r\n- Designated parking \r\n- Overground and underground parking \r\n- Located on highly sought-after road\r\n- Luas stop within 5 minutes' walk \r\n- Citywest shopping centre on your doorstep \r\n- M50 & N7 within easy reach \r\n- Viewing highly advised \r\n\r\nDirections\r\nFrom the Naas Road take Exit 3 for Citywest. At the roundabout at the top of the slip road turn right. Proceed straight ahead until you reach the City West Shopping Centre and at this roundabout continue along and turn left onto Fortunes Lawn and proceed straight where number 75 will be located in the block to the right."
      },
